Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.78,0:01:20.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,自由！自由！自由！\N{\fs50}Freedom! Freedom! Freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:32.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操你妈 FEDRA！操你妈 FEDRA！\N{\fs50}Fuck you, FEDRA! Fuck you, FEDRA!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,再高点！\N{\fs50}Higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:04.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城属于人民\N{\fs50}Kansas City belongs to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:08.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,告密者们 现在投降 你们将会得到公正的审判\N{\fs50}Collaborators, surrender now, and you will receive a fair trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:13.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们已经控制了隔离区和开放区\N{\fs50}We have control of the QZ and the open city.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.09,0:02:17.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,藏匿者们 一经发现 就将面临参与反革命活动的指控\N{\fs50}Anyone caught hiding will face charges of counter-revolutionary activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:20.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城属于人民\N{\fs50}Kansas City belongs to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,告密者们 现在投降…\N{\fs50}Collaborators, surrender now...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:14.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,佩里 你知道吗 曾经我多么害怕面前的这些人\N{\fs50}You know, Perry, I used to be so scared of these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:16.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在 瞧瞧他们\N{\fs50}Now look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.57,0:03:20.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,背叛你的邻居\N{\fs50}Did it feel good,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:23.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把他们出卖给FEDRA 这种感觉很好吗？\N{\fs50}betraying your neighbors to FEDRA?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看着我们被投入监狱\N{\fs50}Watching us get thrown in prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看着我们被吊死\N{\fs50}watching us hang,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:30.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好得到药物\N{\fs50}so that you could get medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:33.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,酒 还有他妈的苹果？\N{\fs50}alcohol, fucking apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这让你们感觉更舒服吗？\N{\fs50}Did it make you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是让你们有了安全感？\N{\fs50}Did it make you feel safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在你们感觉又如何呢？\N{\fs50}How does it make you feel now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:53.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不过 我不是FEDRA\N{\fs50}Well, I'm not FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们很幸运\N{\fs50}Lucky for you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是每个人都得死\N{\fs50}no one here has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:00.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 我们要审判你们\N{\fs50}Yeah, we could put you on trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:02.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们罪有应得 接下来要面对的就是审判\N{\fs50}You're all guilty, so that's how that'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:04.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后在监狱里待着 放松点\N{\fs50}And you'll do some time. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:08.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在那之前 你们得为我出点力\N{\fs50}But first, you have to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利在哪里？\N{\fs50}Where is Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们都是线人\N{\fs50}You're informers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:18.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,线索呢\N{\fs50}Inform.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利在哪里？\N{\fs50}Where is Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看来没人知道\N{\fs50}I guess they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,全杀了\N{\fs50}Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他和埃德尔斯坦医生在一起\N{\fs50}He's with Edelstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:42.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,埃德尔斯坦也是告密者？\N{\fs50}Edelstein was a collaborator?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.70,0:04:46.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗬 比起你们这些傻逼 他真是谨慎多了\N{\fs50}Well, he was a lot more discreet than you fucking idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:52.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他说他要跟亨利和山姆会合\N{\fs50}He said he was meeting up with Henry and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:54.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fs50}'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:57.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他在开放区域有一个藏身之地\N{\fs50}He had a place to hole up in the open city
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:59.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,以防局势变糟\N{\fs50}in case things went bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:04.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可事实上一切顺利 难道你们都没听说吗？\N{\fs50}But things have gone great, haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城解放了\N{\fs50}Kansas City is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:10.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他的藏身点在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Hole up where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:12.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他没说\N{\fs50}He didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:17.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓 只要是我知道的 都已经告诉你了\N{\fs50}I swear, I've told you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fs50}Of course, you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:23.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你这个告密小人\N{\fs50}You're a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:27.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他还藏在城里\N{\fs50}He's still in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:31.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 安排人手挨家挨户搜查 直到找到他\N{\fs50}Okay, I want our people going door-to-door until we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:32.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,现在？\N{\fs50}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:33.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,噢 真不好意思\N{\fs50}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得我们应该等多久？\N{\fs50}How long do you think we should wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等一两天？还是一周？\N{\fs50}Should we wait a day or two? Should we wait a week?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操他的 还是给他一个月时间吧\N{\fs50}Fuck it. Let's give him a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:42.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的意思不是什么都不做\N{\fs50}I'm not sayin' we do nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:43.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们已经围绕着城市排布了封锁线\N{\fs50}We already got a perimeter around the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:45.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等他自投罗网就好 挨家挨户搜查需要很多人手\N{\fs50}We can wait him out. Door-to-door would take a lotta men,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:46.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,原本很多必须做的事情就——\N{\fs50}and there are other things that probably need--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:50.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,佩里 亨利的下落对我至关重要\N{\fs50}He's not my seventh priority, Perry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:51.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,难道你就不在意他？\N{\fs50}Is that what he is to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:55.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在意\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们真要审判他们？\N{\fs50}Are we really puttin' 'em on trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:06.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 不需要这么做\N{\fs50}No, we are not really putting them on trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:09.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们完事以后 直接把尸体烧了 这样速度更快\N{\fs50}When you're done, burn the bodies. It's faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你确定他们不知道这地方吗？\N{\fs50}You sure they don't know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:28.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是我从一位FEDRA官员那里得知的\N{\fs50}I got it from a FEDRA officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:31.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的一个病人\N{\fs50}Patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,欠我人情\N{\fs50}Owed me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:37.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他说这是他自己找到的 没告诉过任何人\N{\fs50}He said he found it himself, never told anyone about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:38.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果他们抓到了他 怎么办？\N{\fs50}And what if they get to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:39.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,已经抓到了\N{\fs50}They already did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:41.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 他也不会再开口了 - 操\N{\fs50}-He won't be talking. -Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:44.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 水怎么办？有厕所吗？\N{\fs50}Okay. Water? Toilets?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:49.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,底层公寓和隔离区主管道相连\N{\fs50}The apartments below are tied into the QZ main.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:52.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们可以去下边用 但速度要快 要格外小心\N{\fs50}We can use those, but we have to be fast and careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:53.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,吃的呢？\N{\fs50}Food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:54.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你带了多少就有多少\N{\fs50}Whatever you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:56.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我勉强才逃了出来\N{\fs50}I barely made it out as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:57.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我们要栽食物上面了？\N{\fs50}So we're fucked on food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:58.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,弹药呢？\N{\fs50}Ammunition?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:07:59.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,空的\N{\fs50}Empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:00.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我的也是\N{\fs50}Yeah, so is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,反正我们也不打算开枪杀出血路\N{\fs50}We weren't shooting our way outta this anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 我们还是得偷摸溜出去\N{\fs50}No, so we'll sneak our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么做？\N{\fs50}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:10.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,地道\N{\fs50}Tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:12.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,地道？\N{\fs50}Tunnels?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么麻烦干啥？\N{\fs50}Why go to the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想自杀 在这就行\N{\fs50}You can kill yourself right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,二十个罐头 还有六磅肉干 这是我们三人的口粮\N{\fs50}Twenty cans, and six pounds of jerky for the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果按最低限度来分配\N{\fs50}If we stick to the minimum,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我估计能撑11天？\N{\fs50}I think we can make it 11 days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:25.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就是我们得设法逃出去的期限\N{\fs50}So that's how long we have to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:28.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他被吓坏了？\N{\fs50}Is he scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:32.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 他目睹了很多事情\N{\fs50}Yeah. Well, he saw a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我现在也无能为力\N{\fs50}Nothin' I can do about that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:39.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他感到害怕 是因为你也如此\N{\fs50}He's scared because you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:10:59.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,会吧 会的\N{\fs50}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:22.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔\N{\fs50}Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:30.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我\N{\fs50}Eyes on me. Eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不用想说辞\N{\fs50}You don't have to worry about what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你们\N{\fs50}We don't wanna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,反而是想要帮助你们\N{\fs50}We wanna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:40.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,行\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.45,0:16:43.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fs50}Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:47.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不清楚在这种情况下 接下来该做些什么\N{\fs50}I don't know what the next step is with something like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但如果我把枪放下\N{\fs50}but if I lower my gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没伤害你们是吧\N{\fs50}we didn't hurt you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以你们也不会伤害我们\N{\fs50}so you don't hurt us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:53.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对不对？\N{\fs50}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fs50}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老兄 你的语调也太他妈阴阳怪气了\N{\fs50}That's a weird fuckin' tone, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他就这腔调 一开口就像个混蛋\N{\fs50}That's just the way he sounds. He has an asshole voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:02.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔 跟他好好说话\N{\fs50}Joel, tell him he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:05.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一切好极了\N{\fs50}Everything is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.33,0:17:06.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老兄啊\N{\fs50}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:07.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fs50}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:10.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 听我说\N{\fs50}Okay. Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:12.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我选择相信你们\N{\fs50}I'm gonna trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:23.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但倘若你俩当中任何一人轻举妄动\N{\fs50}But if either of you guys try anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:26.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,试试看？\N{\fs50}yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:28.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fs50}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:30.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:40.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能坐起来吗？\N{\fs50}Can I sit up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:42.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可以\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:44.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fs50}Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:46.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,慢慢起身\N{\fs50}Get up slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:57.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fs50}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:02.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我叫亨利\N{\fs50}My name's Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他是我的弟弟 山姆\N{\fs50}That's my brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:08.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是堪萨斯城头号通缉犯\N{\fs50}I'm the most wanted man in Kansas City.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:09.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我猜 现在的话\N{\fs50}Although right now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:14.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你俩快赶上我了\N{\fs50}my guess is you're running a close second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:28.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你从哪搞来这些？\N{\fs50}Where'd you get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:29.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,比尔那里\N{\fs50}From Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:31.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fs50}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:52.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他说谢谢你们\N{\fs50}He says thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我猜你们的食物不多 所以 这很难得\N{\fs50}I'm guessing you don't have much, so, this means a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:58.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他多大了\N{\fs50}How old is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他八岁\N{\fs50}He's eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:05.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很棒\N{\fs50}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我叫艾莉\N{\fs50}I'm Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:22.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我叫乔尔 瞧 东西也吃了 也没有闹出人命\N{\fs50}I'm Joel. Look, you ate, we didn't kill each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:24.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么也算双赢吧 是不是可以翻篇了\N{\fs50}let's call this a win-win and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:28.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好 我敢说\N{\fs50}Well, I'm betting,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:29.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们来这地方\N{\fs50}that y'all came up here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是打算先观察一下整个城市 再想办法逃出去\N{\fs50}to get a view of the city and plan a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:34.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不如等天亮以后\N{\fs50}And when the sun's up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我告诉你们该怎么走\N{\fs50}I'll show you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:42.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到罪恶之城堪萨斯\N{\fs50}Welcome to Killa City.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:43.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有FEDRA的人\N{\fs50}No FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:45.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,10天前还不是现在这样 但你说的对\N{\fs50}Not as of 10 days ago, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:46.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,经常听说这里的FEDRA就像——\N{\fs50}We always heard KC FEDRA was--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.99,0:19:48.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怪物？野蛮人？\N{\fs50}Monsters? Savages?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:51.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 这些都是真的\N{\fs50}Yeah, you heard right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:54.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这20年来 他们强奸 折磨 杀害人民\N{\fs50}Raped and tortured and murdered people for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:57.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道长此以往会发生什么吗？\N{\fs50}And you know what happens when you do that to people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,受害者一旦找到机会 就会原样奉还\N{\fs50}The moment they get a chance, they do it right back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:01.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你不是FEDRA\N{\fs50}But you're not FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错 可我更恶劣\N{\fs50}No, worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:08.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是个告密者\N{\fs50}I'm a collaborator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:11.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不和告密小人合作\N{\fs50}I don't work with rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:13.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,得了吧 你他妈必须合作\N{\fs50}Yeah, you fucking do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,今天你就得跟我合作\N{\fs50}Today you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为我是本地人 你不是\N{\fs50}'cause I live here and you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我能追踪你 一路跟到这儿\N{\fs50}That's how I followed you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:21.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我对这个城市了如指掌 也能帮助你们逃出生天\N{\fs50}I know this city, and that's how I'm gonna help you get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:24.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么要帮我们？\N{\fs50}Why help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:27.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看到了你的本事\N{\fs50}I saw what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:28.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么干掉敌人\N{\fs50}the way you killed those men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:31.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道往哪儿走\N{\fs50}Now, I know where to go
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:33.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我没办法活着逃出去\N{\fs50}but I don't know how to make it through alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.27,0:20:34.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,仅仅靠我和山姆是不可能的\N{\fs50}Not if it's just me and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:36.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你看起来有能力办到 你有枪\N{\fs50}You seem capable enough. You're armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:37.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你错了 大错特错\N{\fs50}You're wrong, and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:40.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从没杀过人\N{\fs50}Never killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:42.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,用一把没上膛的枪指着你\N{\fs50}And pointing an unloaded gun at you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:44.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那是我有生以来最暴力的行为\N{\fs50}was the closest I've ever come to being violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:48.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们来谈谈条件吧\N{\fs50}So that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:50.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我跟你说往哪儿走\N{\fs50}I show the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:52.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你负责清路\N{\fs50}you clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好久没听到过笑声了\N{\fs50}Haven't heard that in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:11.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们该怎么逃出去？\N{\fs50}So how are we gettin' out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:24.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是高速路 这是市区\N{\fs50}Highways, downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们在这里\N{\fs50}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:28.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,整片区域都归凯瑟琳\N{\fs50}This whole area belongs to Kathleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:30.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她说了算？\N{\fs50}She's in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:31.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,反抗军的领袖\N{\fs50}Leader of the resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:34.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你可以看出来 我们被高速路围住了\N{\fs50}You can see the way we're bounded by highways.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:37.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们派人驻守高速路的内侧\N{\fs50}They got people posted all around the inside perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:39.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们一旦接近 就会被抓\N{\fs50}If we get close, we get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:40.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问\N{\fs50}No question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.59,0:21:42.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么穿过去？\N{\fs50}So how do we get across?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:02.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:04.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城有地铁？\N{\fs50}Kansas City has a subway?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:06.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有 但有用于维修建筑的地道\N{\fs50}No, but they do have maintenance tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:09.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有很多大楼都是由相同的开发商修建的\N{\fs50}There's a bunch of buildings all put up by the same developers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这些建筑共用维修地道 其中包括\N{\fs50}And they share these tunnels, including,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:12.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里的一栋银行大楼\N{\fs50}a bank building here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:14.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们从这里进入地道\N{\fs50}So we enter the tunnels here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:16.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走地下 然后从这儿出来\N{\fs50}travel underground, and pop up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:18.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里叫西区北 是住宅区\N{\fs50}Westside North. Residential.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:21.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,住宅区的另一侧就是堤坝\N{\fs50}There's an embankment on the other side of the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:22.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们从堤坝下去\N{\fs50}We head down,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:24.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,通过人行桥过河\N{\fs50}pedestrian bridge over the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:26.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就可以重获自由\N{\fs50}free as a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你说得没错 这个计划妙极了\N{\fs50}You're right. It's a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:31.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还需要我干什么？\N{\fs50}So what do you need me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.01,0:22:37.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你注没注意到 城里有些奇怪？\N{\fs50}You noticed anything strange about this city?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:39.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,除了你们已经见识过的破事以外\N{\fs50}Other than the strange shit you've already seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:40.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有感染者？\N{\fs50}No Infected?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实是有的\N{\fs50}There's Infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:44.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只是不在地面上而已\N{\fs50}Just not on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,15年前 FEDRA把他们赶到了地下\N{\fs50}FEDRA drove them underground 15 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:48.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让他们没法回来\N{\fs50}and never let them come back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.61,0:22:50.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那帮法西斯混蛋们干过的唯一好事\N{\fs50}It's the only good thing those fascist motherfuckers ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.61,0:22:52.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗬 你让我俩走地道 是因为这个？\N{\fs50}So you want us goin' into a tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:54.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,每个人都说地道里满是感染者\N{\fs50}Everyone thinks that it's full of Infected,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:56.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就连凯瑟琳都这么认为 这样一来\N{\fs50}including Kathleen, which means that we're not gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:22:58.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们绝不会碰见她手下任何人\N{\fs50}running into any of her people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.91,0:23:01.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可就我所知\N{\fs50}But you see, what I know is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.46,0:23:02.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,地道是空的\N{\fs50}it's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你去过地道？\N{\fs50}You've been down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:08.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 这是我从FEDRA的人那里听说的 我俩合作过\N{\fs50}No, but the FEDRA guy that I worked with
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.17,0:23:10.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他跟我说地道很安全 绝对安全\N{\fs50}told me that it's clean, completely clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:11.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们清理过地道 彻彻底底\N{\fs50}They cleared it out. All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.91,0:23:12.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么时候？\N{\fs50}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:14.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大概三年前\N{\fs50}Like, three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.97,0:23:18.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧 或许有一两个感染者吧\N{\fs50}Okay, maybe, there's one or two,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你对付得了\N{\fs50}but you handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:20.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,万一有更多感染者怎么办？\N{\fs50}What if there's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:22.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或者有像蝙蝠那样循声定位的怪物？\N{\fs50}Or one of those blind ones that sees like a bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.35,0:23:24.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等等 你们遇到过循声者？\N{\fs50}Wait, you ran into a Clicker?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.27,0:23:26.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 两个 - 但你们还活到了现在\N{\fs50}-Two of 'em. -And you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.94,0:23:27.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧？\N{\fs50}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们选对人了\N{\fs50}You're the right people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:32.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果地道里的情况很糟 就别往前走了\N{\fs50}If it gets bad down there, we turn around,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:34.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,马上原路返回\N{\fs50}and run right back out the same way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:35.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就是你的完美计划？\N{\fs50}That's your great plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.58,0:23:37.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 这是我的赌命一搏计划\N{\fs50}No, that's my dicey-as-fuck plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.33,0:23:39.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在我看来\N{\fs50}But as far as I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:43.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这也是我们唯一的机会\N{\fs50}it's our only shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.09,0:23:54.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们说要帮助我们逃出去\N{\fs50}They're saying they're going to help us escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.31,0:23:59.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fs50}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:18.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们应该躲起来 别让其他人看到\N{\fs50}We need to get outta sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.29,0:24:21.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我记得是这边\N{\fs50}I think it's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.26,0:24:35.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,应该就是这儿了\N{\fs50}This should be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:37.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备好了没？\N{\fs50}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:40.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把你的枪掏出来\N{\fs50}Get your gun out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.41,0:25:05.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看到没？这里空荡荡的\N{\fs50}You see? It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,计划天衣无缝\N{\fs50}The plan is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.29,0:25:08.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“计划天衣无缝”？\N{\fs50}"The plan is good"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.88,0:25:10.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们下到这儿才不过两秒钟\N{\fs50}We've been down here two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.30,0:25:11.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对里面的情况还一无所知\N{\fs50}We don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:13.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你爸还挺悲观\N{\fs50}Your dad's kind of a pessimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:15.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 他不是我爸 - 我不是她爸\N{\fs50}-He's not my dad. -I'm not her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.55,0:25:17.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把你的手电往前方照\N{\fs50}Just point your light forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.14,0:25:19.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,随时准备逃命\N{\fs50}and be ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.57,0:26:17.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别轻举妄动\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.28,0:26:59.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我听说过这样的地方\N{\fs50}I heard about places like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:01.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,自爆发日之后 人们藏到地下\N{\fs50}People went underground after Outbreak Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:03.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,建造可以定居的地方\N{\fs50}Built settlements.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:04.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,后来呢 发生了什么？\N{\fs50}What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.66,0:27:08.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,估计有人没遵守规定 导致所有人都被感染了\N{\fs50}Maybe they didn't follow the rules and they all got infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:32.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是吧！我超爱这漫画\N{\fs50}No way! I love these.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:40.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有很多册\N{\fs50}I have issues
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.07,0:27:44.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,4 5 6 11我有这几册\N{\fs50}four, five, six, 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:53.88,Subtitle-TLOU-自由标注-无边框阴影,,0,0,0,,{\frz18.49\pos(1270,569.999)\c&H222b24\b1}我有第1 5 6 8册
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.09,0:27:55.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,超酷的\N{\fs50}So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.82,0:28:11.20,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是《原始星芒》的主角在激战之后说的台词
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.09,0:28:06.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“从宇宙的彼方归来\N{\fs50}"To the edge of the universe and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.89,0:28:10.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,排除万难 死里逃生”\N{\fs50}Endure and survive."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.39,0:28:13.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,排除万难\N{\fs50}Endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.94,0:28:15.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,死里逃生\N{\fs50}Survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.61,0:28:17.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,排除万难 死里逃生\N{\fs50}Endure. Survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.86,0:28:20.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真他妈酷 哥们！\N{\fs50}Fuck yeah, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.32,0:28:21.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 小声点 我们还没出去\N{\fs50}Hey, keep it down. We're not out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.84,0:28:22.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fs50}C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.90,0:28:24.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,咱就不能在这歇会儿吗？\N{\fs50}Can we just rest here for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,难得这儿有些能做的事儿\N{\fs50}There's actually shit to do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.45,0:28:28.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等天黑了再走也不是坏事\N{\fs50}Wouldn't be so bad to wait the light out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.58,0:28:30.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,入夜了再从另一头出去安全些\N{\fs50}Safer in shadows when we pop back out on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.38,0:28:46.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,耶！行不行啊！好！\N{\fs50}Yes! Come on! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.30,0:28:49.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来 传球回来\N{\fs50}Come on. Pass it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:52.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fs50}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.35,0:28:54.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.61,0:29:00.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你\N{\fs50}If you were
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.40,0:29:02.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是为了他才告的密\N{\fs50}collaboratin' to take care of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.11,0:29:07.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不该说那些话的\N{\fs50}I shouldn't have said what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:09.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道你的处境\N{\fs50}I don't know your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.29,0:29:11.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不是说他们该就此放手 但\N{\fs50}And I'm not sayin' they should let it go, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.74,0:29:13.20,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,太屌了！\N{\fs50}That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.29,0:29:15.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,考虑到这些 派出一整只军队来追杀你——\N{\fs50}All things considered, seems kinda cruel--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.75,0:29:16.83,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.54,0:29:19.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感觉有些不人道\N{\fs50}to send a whole army after you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:20.88,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.55,0:29:26.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 其实我之前\N{\fs50}You know, I wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.72,0:29:29.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没有完全说实话\N{\fs50}exactly telling you the truth before
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:33.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,关于没杀过人这点\N{\fs50}about me not killing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.48,0:29:37.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,曾经有个人 一个伟大的人\N{\fs50}There was a man, a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.90,0:29:40.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他从不害怕\N{\fs50}You know, he was never afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:42.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,绝不自私\N{\fs50}never selfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.86,0:29:45.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,总是很宽容\N{\fs50}and he was always forgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.62,0:29:50.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你遇到过这样的人吗？\N{\fs50}Have you ever met someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.66,0:29:52.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那种 你愿意跟随到天涯海角的人\N{\fs50}Kinda man you'd follow anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.25,0:29:55.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我是说 我本来想那样\N{\fs50}I mean, I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我本可以的\N{\fs50}Well, I would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.71,0:30:01.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fs50}Yeah, but
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:04.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,山姆 他\N{\fs50}Sam, he
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:07.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他病了\N{\fs50}he got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.30,0:30:09.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,白血病\N{\fs50}Leukemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.39,0:30:15.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 总之\N{\fs50}Yeah, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:17.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有种药能治他的病\N{\fs50}there was one drug that worked,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.81,0:30:21.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后 想不到吧\N{\fs50}and, whoa, big shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:23.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这药没多少了\N{\fs50}there wasn't much left of it
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.32,0:30:25.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而且都在FEDRA手上\N{\fs50}and it belonged to FEDRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.65,0:30:27.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果我想要的话\N{\fs50}And if I wanted some,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.49,0:30:29.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就得干件大的\N{\fs50}it was gonna take something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.37,0:30:33.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我给了他们件大的\N{\fs50}So I gave them something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:36.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那个伟大的人\N{\fs50}That one great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:41.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,堪萨斯城起义运动的领袖\N{\fs50}The leader of the resistance movement in Kansas City.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.42,0:30:47.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳的哥哥\N{\fs50}And Kathleen's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fs50}Yeah, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:53.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还觉得他们不该对我下手这么狠吗？\N{\fs50}you still think they should take it easy on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.97,0:30:55.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是说 我才是那个坏人？\N{\fs50}Or am I the bad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.56,0:30:59.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在等个啥 老兄\N{\fs50}I don't know what you're waitin' on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.23,0:31:00.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,答案很简单\N{\fs50}The answer's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.02,0:31:03.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就是那个坏人 因为我做了坏事\N{\fs50}I am the bad guy because I did a bad guy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.70,0:31:11.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你能理解\N{\fs50}But you get it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:13.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你也许不是她的父亲\N{\fs50}You might not be her father,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.24,0:31:14.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你曾是某人的父亲\N{\fs50}but you were someone's.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.70,0:31:17.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看得出来\N{\fs50}See, I could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.75,0:31:25.80,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,喂 他去哪儿了？\N{\fs50}Yeah, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.88,0:31:27.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们等得够久了\N{\fs50}We've waited long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.99,0:31:58.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 怎样？ - 我们还没找到他们\N{\fs50}-And? -We haven't found 'em yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:01.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,杀了布莱恩的那个人呢？\N{\fs50}What about the man who killed Bryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.67,0:32:03.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,看来\N{\fs50}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:06.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不是很顺利啊\N{\fs50}we're not doin' so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:12.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谁告诉你我在这儿的？\N{\fs50}Who told you I was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.68,0:32:13.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的妈妈\N{\fs50}Your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.89,0:32:16.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你为什么要找我妈说话？\N{\fs50}Why are you talking to my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.72,0:32:20.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不知道你在哪儿\N{\fs50}We didn't know where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.48,0:32:28.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你回到过你长大的房间吗？\N{\fs50}Have you been back to the room you grew up in?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.15,0:32:29.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没 操 没回过\N{\fs50}No. Fuck no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.61,0:32:31.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好几百英里的路呢\N{\fs50}It's a couple hundred miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:33.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去一趟不值得\N{\fs50}It's not exactly worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.74,0:32:34.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fs50}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.66,0:32:41.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,迈克尔和我还小的时候\N{\fs50}When Michael and I were little,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.62,0:32:44.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,感觉这房间是那么地大\N{\fs50}this room seemed so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.21,0:32:50.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我小时候很怕打雷\N{\fs50}I was really scared of thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.13,0:32:52.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以 每当暴风雨来临时\N{\fs50}so when there was a storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.43,0:32:58.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,迈克尔就会告诉我这不是一个房间\N{\fs50}Michael told me that this wasn't a room at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.97,0:33:01.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这其实是一个\N{\fs50}That this was actually
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.10,0:33:03.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很大的木盒子\N{\fs50}just a big, wooden box.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.02,0:33:07.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有什么能进到这个大木盒子里\N{\fs50}A big, wooden box that nothing could get inside of.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.65,0:33:11.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论是闪电 飓风\N{\fs50}And it didn't matter if there was lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.98,0:33:14.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是子弹\N{\fs50}or tornadoes or gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.37,0:33:22.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他说只要我们在一起\N{\fs50}He said as long as we were together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.41,0:33:25.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,待在我们完美的盒子里\N{\fs50}in our perfect box,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.87,0:33:28.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们就会很安全\N{\fs50}we would be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.26,0:33:33.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他为我这么做\N{\fs50}He did that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.63,0:33:37.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他一直在做这样的事\N{\fs50}And he did stuff like that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.76,0:33:42.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他是个如此美好的人\N{\fs50}He was so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.02,0:33:50.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我不是\N{\fs50}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:53.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我从来都不是\N{\fs50}I never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:58.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他要是看到我的所作所为 会吓坏的\N{\fs50}He would be horrified by the things I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.78,0:34:00.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果 你来是想要告诉我\N{\fs50}And if you've come to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.08,0:34:04.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,迈克尔不会希望我去伤害亨利\N{\fs50}that Michael wouldn't want me to hurt Henry
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.87,0:34:08.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而是希望我宽恕他的话\N{\fs50}that he would want me to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这我也知道\N{\fs50}I know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.25,0:34:13.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他和我说过\N{\fs50}He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.76,0:34:19.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在监狱里 我最后一次见到活生生的他\N{\fs50}The last time I saw him alive in jail
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.60,0:34:24.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他告诉我 要宽恕\N{\fs50}he told me to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:33.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他为此得到了什么下场？\N{\fs50}And what did he get for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.57,0:34:37.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这有什么公道可言？\N{\fs50}Where is the justice in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.03,0:34:40.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这有什么意义？\N{\fs50}What is the point of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.83,0:34:47.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你的哥哥是个伟大的人 我们都爱他\N{\fs50}Your brother was a great man. We all loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:48.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但\N{\fs50}But
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.71,0:34:52.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他什么都没能改变\N{\fs50}he didn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而你改变一切\N{\fs50}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.13,0:35:00.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们会跟随你\N{\fs50}We're with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.73,0:35:09.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.86,0:35:24.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你知道我们在哪儿吗？ - 知道\N{\fs50}-Do you know where we are? -Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.03,0:35:26.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在另一边\N{\fs50}The other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.06,0:35:51.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 这里没有人\N{\fs50}No. No one is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.44,0:35:55.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也不会有人来 因为我的计划奏效了\N{\fs50}No one's gonna be here because my plan worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:57.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,话真他妈多\N{\fs50}So much goddamn talkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.65,0:35:59.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就是说说 我言出必践\N{\fs50}I'm just saying, I delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:02.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,向右转 沿着街走\N{\fs50}Make this right, go down the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.74,0:36:04.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,过了最后一栋房子后面的堤坝\N{\fs50}embankment behind the last house
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.74,0:36:07.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们就出去了\N{\fs50}and we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.04,0:36:09.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那 过了河之后呢？\N{\fs50}So we cross the river and then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.95,0:36:10.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们要去哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where ya gonna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.94,0:36:12.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还不知道\N{\fs50}Don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.25,0:36:14.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们要去怀俄明州\N{\fs50}Well, we're goin' to Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.50,0:36:15.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么了？怀俄明州这么大\N{\fs50}What? It's a huge state.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:17.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,多两个人也没关系\N{\fs50}It can fit two more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.88,0:36:21.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要不我们还是庆幸眼下的胜利\N{\fs50}Yeah, maybe we just call this one a success
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.59,0:36:22.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后就此别过吧\N{\fs50}and say our fond farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:24.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不 他会改主意的 相信我\N{\fs50}No, he'll change his mind. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.55,0:36:25.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一般是这样的\N{\fs50}This is how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:29.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他会说“想都别想 艾莉 绝对 绝对不可能”\N{\fs50}He's like, "No, Ellie. Never, ever, ever happening."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.72,0:36:33.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我就会“我要再问你一百万遍 ”\N{\fs50}And then I'm like, "I'm gonna ask you a million more times."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.56,0:36:34.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后他就——\N{\fs50}And he's like--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.90,0:36:37.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走 走！\N{\fs50}Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.44,0:36:38.48,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fs50}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.53,0:36:40.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那他妈是哪儿来的？\N{\fs50}The fuck is that comin' from?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:41.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fs50}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.58,0:36:53.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操 好吧 妈的 快走 快走\N{\fs50}Shit. Alright, fuck. Let's move. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.08,0:36:53.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\fs50}What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.64,0:36:55.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们他妈的要离开这儿！\N{\fs50}Gettin' the fuck outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.12,0:36:56.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操 我操\N{\fs50}Oh shit, oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.13,0:37:02.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们怎么办？\N{\fs50}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.22,0:37:10.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.68,0:37:11.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,待在这儿\N{\fs50}Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.72,0:37:12.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.64,0:37:16.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你只要不动 他就不会朝你开枪\N{\fs50}If you don't move, he's not gonna hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.35,0:37:19.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我要绕过去 从后边进到房子里面\N{\fs50}I'm gonna go around, try to get in the house through the back,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.11,0:37:19.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后把他干掉\N{\fs50}and then I'll take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.07,0:37:21.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但如果你走出去 他会杀了你的\N{\fs50}But if you go out there, he's gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.61,0:37:22.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,天这么黑 他枪法又烂\N{\fs50}It's dark and he has shit aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.03,0:37:23.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没人会杀了我\N{\fs50}Nobody's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.07,0:37:25.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那他会杀了我们\N{\fs50}Then he's gonna kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:29.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你相信我吗？\N{\fs50}Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.24,0:38:56.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪放下 滑到我这儿来\N{\fs50}Put the gun down, slide it over to me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.04,0:38:58.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后在这上边再待一个小时\N{\fs50}and then stay up here for another hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.88,0:39:02.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要做的就这些\N{\fs50}That's all you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.92,0:39:07.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托 不要冲动\N{\fs50}Please don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.22,0:39:09.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fs50}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.90,0:39:31.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,安东尼？安东尼？\N{\fs50}Anthony? Anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.91,0:39:36.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,安东尼 拖住他们\N{\fs50}Anthony, hold them where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.79,0:39:37.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们马上到\N{\fs50}We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:39.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.37,0:39:41.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fs50}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.54,0:39:46.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fs50}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.17,0:39:51.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fs50}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.47,0:39:54.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这里到处都是车\N{\fs50}There's cars everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.51,0:39:56.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那你觉得为什么让你在前面？开路\N{\fs50}Why do you think you're in front? Clear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:04.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快走！走 走 走 走！\N{\fs50}Go! Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.51,0:41:15.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你们没事吧？\N{\fs50}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.91,0:41:16.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.31,0:41:24.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他在上边\N{\fs50}He's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:25.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.77,0:41:28.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,两人一组！绕后边去 把他干掉！\N{\fs50}Two and two! Around the back, take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:34.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无路可逃了 亨利\N{\fs50}Dead end, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.95,0:41:39.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,要出来吗？咱们省点时间？\N{\fs50}Gonna step on out? Save us some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.66,0:41:42.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不要？\N{\fs50}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.54,0:41:46.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没关系 没区别\N{\fs50}That's all right. Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.75,0:41:51.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我这就出来！\N{\fs50}I'll come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.55,0:41:55.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放孩子们走吧！\N{\fs50}Just let the kids go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.63,0:41:56.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.93,0:41:58.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fs50}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.01,0:42:00.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那女孩的同伙杀了布莱恩\N{\fs50}The girl is with the man who killed Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.89,0:42:02.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而山姆\N{\fs50}And Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.35,0:42:04.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,山姆的同伙是你\N{\fs50}well, Sam's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.46,0:42:05.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你不明白！\N{\fs50}You don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.43,0:42:06.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fs50}But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.94,0:42:08.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很清楚你这么做的原因\N{\fs50}I know why you did what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.06,0:42:13.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你有没有好好想过 也许他就该死？\N{\fs50}But did you ever stop to think that maybe he was supposed to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.73,0:42:14.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他他妈只是个孩子！\N{\fs50}He's just a fucking kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.11,0:42:19.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,孩子也会死啊 亨利\N{\fs50}Well, kids die, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.28,0:42:21.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们每天都会死\N{\fs50}They die all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.49,0:42:25.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得整个世界都围着他转？\N{\fs50}You think the whole world revolves around him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.79,0:42:27.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他就非比\N{\fs50}That he's worth
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.29,0:42:29.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一切都重要？\N{\fs50}everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.50,0:42:34.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你要和命运作对 就是这个下场\N{\fs50}Well, this is what happens when you fuck with fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.05,0:42:41.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备好带着他跑 必须这样\N{\fs50}Get ready to take him and run. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.05,0:42:42.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就这么做\N{\fs50}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.56,0:42:49.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是时候了 亨利\N{\fs50}It's time, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.85,0:42:50.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,够了！\N{\fs50}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.15,0:42:57.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.72,0:43:24.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,该怎么结束 就怎么结束\N{\fs50}It ends the way it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.21,0:44:33.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fs50}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.80,0:44:48.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,碾死他们！碾死他们！\N{\fs50}Run 'em down! Run 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.32,0:45:45.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快跑 找掩体 别回头\N{\fs50}Run. Find cover. Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.66,0:45:47.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fs50}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.53,0:46:31.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,帮我！快他妈滚！\N{\fs50}Help! Get the fuck away!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.49,0:46:32.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,离我他妈远点！\N{\fs50}Get the fuck off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.10,0:47:00.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,山姆！\N{\fs50}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.86,0:47:05.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快走 快走！\N{\fs50}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.24,0:47:07.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走 走！\N{\fs50}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.78,0:47:14.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,停下！\N{\fs50}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.18,0:47:35.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走这边！快走！\N{\fs50}This way now! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.08,0:47:58.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“嘣\N{\fs50}"Pew.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.16,0:48:02.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“嘣\N{\fs50}"Pew.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.21,0:48:03.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“正当渡鸦一号\N{\fs50}"As the Raven 01
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.79,0:48:05.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,接近那颗红色星球时”\N{\fs50}approaches the red planet."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.38,0:48:06.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会没事吗？\N{\fs50}You think they'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.59,0:48:09.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 会没事的\N{\fs50}Yeah, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.47,0:48:13.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,孩子反而还过得轻松些\N{\fs50}It's easier when you're a kid anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.52,0:48:21.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不会有谁依赖你\N{\fs50}You don't have anybody else relying on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.19,0:48:24.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这才是难的地方\N{\fs50}That's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.44,0:48:26.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那\N{\fs50}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.27,0:48:28.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们干得还不错\N{\fs50}I guess we're doing a good job then.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.40,0:48:34.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那漫画书怎么说的来着？\N{\fs50}What's that comic book say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.49,0:48:35.97,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“排除万难 死里逃生”？\N{\fs50}"Endure and survive"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.97,0:48:37.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“排除万难 死里逃生”\N{\fs50}"Endure and survive."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.33,0:48:41.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不就是废话么\N{\fs50}That shit's redundant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.56,0:48:42.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 写得不咋样\N{\fs50}Yeah, it's not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.58,0:48:44.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.17,0:48:51.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 我不清楚具体要怎么去到怀俄明州\N{\fs50}Look, I don't know exactly how I'm gettin' to Wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.42,0:48:52.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大概率要走着去\N{\fs50}I'm probably walkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.68,0:48:54.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fs50}But
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.43,0:48:57.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你懂的 如果你想的话\N{\fs50}you know, if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.66,0:48:58.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.31,0:49:00.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.89,0:49:04.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好啊 我觉得山姆有个朋友挺好的\N{\fs50}Yeah, I think it'd be nice for Sam to have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.02,0:49:07.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明早再告诉他\N{\fs50}I'll tell him in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.40,0:49:10.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,新的一天 新的开始\N{\fs50}New day, new start.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“中了！\N{\fs50}"Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.11,0:49:17.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们该敲门吗？”\N{\fs50}Should we knock?"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.16,0:49:20.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs50}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.28,0:49:55.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我没看到任何异常现象\N{\fs50}"I don't see any weird movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.15,0:49:57.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“迟滞呢？没有\N{\fs50}"Stiff? Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.36,0:49:59.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“153区有损坏“\N{\fs50}"Damage here in Sector 153.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.20,0:50:00.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“斯黛拉 你能听见我吗？\N{\fs50}"Stella, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.37,0:50:02.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我能听见”\N{\fs50}I read you."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.41,0:50:03.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好 从这儿开始读\N{\fs50}Okay, from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.52,0:50:26.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我看起来是不害怕的样子吗？\N{\fs50}Do I not look scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.16,0:50:42.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“从不”\N{\fs50}"Never."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.12,0:50:52.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我一直都很怕\N{\fs50}I'm scared all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:06.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,蝎子！\N{\fs50}of scorpions!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:52:00.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,……那内心还会是他自己吗？\N{\fs50}...is it still you inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.45,0:52:09.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.64,0:52:31.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的血\N{\fs50}My blood
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.77,0:52:34.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是解药\N{\fs50}is medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.46,0:53:42.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fs50}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.59,0:53:50.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,保证 保证\N{\fs50}Promise. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.80,0:54:23.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs50}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:48.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 乔尔！\N{\fs50}-Nope, nope, nope. -Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:52.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,乔尔！\N{\fs50}Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.42,0:55:07.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.47,0:55:11.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fs50}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.35,0:55:19.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静 冷静\N{\fs50}Easy, easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.73,0:55:22.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利 把枪给我\N{\fs50}Henry, gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.23,0:55:23.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利 把枪给我\N{\fs50}Henry, gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.02,0:55:25.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做了什么？\N{\fs50}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.07,0:55:27.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我做了什么？\N{\fs50}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.61,0:55:30.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我 我 我做了什么？\N{\fs50}What-what-what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.32,0:55:33.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,山姆？\N{\fs50}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.01,0:55:34.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利 把枪给我\N{\fs50}Henry, gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.00,0:55:38.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fs50}Gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.79,0:55:40.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我 亨利\N{\fs50}Gimme the gun, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.04,0:55:42.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fs50}Gimme the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.67,0:55:43.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,亨利 不要！\N{\fs50}Henry, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.84,0:55:48.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fs50}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.53,0:56:55.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哪边是西？\N{\fs50}Which way's west?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.31,0:57:21.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fs50}Let's go.
