Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.32,0:58:01.76,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,你想让我留在你心上\N{\fs50}♪ Do you want me on your mind ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.85,0:58:07.81,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,还是想让我离去\N{\fs50}♪ Or do you want me to go on ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.48,0:58:16.24,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,或许我能肯定 我属于你\N{\fs50}♪ I might be yours as sure as I can say ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.20,0:58:21.45,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,即便远远离去\N{\fs50}♪ Be gone be faraway ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.64,0:58:29.13,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fs50}♪ Ooh ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.29,0:58:36.47,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fs50}♪ Ooh ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.55,0:58:41.93,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,也不过像火上添油\N{\fs50}♪ Like fuel to fire ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.44,0:58:58.57,Subtitle-TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,孤单地吟唱\N{\fs50}♪ Sing quietly along ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:27.12,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,只看着我 别看其他地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.83,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,450,0,0,,我们快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:31.38,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,还有两个街区
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:36.21,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,320,0,0,,坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:39.71,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,990,0,140,,{\fad(500,500)}我们要上楼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.60,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他刚刚说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.53,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,900,0,,{\fad(500,500)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:33.27,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,900,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.18,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,900,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:09:01.02,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,330,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}超级山姆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:10.17,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,600,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}他说我们在这儿很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.90,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,没人能发现我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:16.11,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}百分之百
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:17.47,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,150,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.89,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}看看我？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:22.04,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}我看起来是害怕的样子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:30.29,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}但这里有一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.59,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,350,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}看这地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.38,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,240,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}丑死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:39.45,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,700,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我们晚点再开那个罐头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:02.01,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,470,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}晚一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:03.68,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他什么时候回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:04.76,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:06.52,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}已经过了一整天了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:10.10,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}食物难找
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:13.19,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}但他还{\b1}会{\b0}回来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:11.96,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.13,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.55,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}我们没吃的了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:21.32,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,380,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}得离开这了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:24.47,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}我一直在观察他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.33,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}我看出来了他们的行动规律
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:31.18,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}没有车 我们也出得去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.90,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,10,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他们杀了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:40.40,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,380,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}八九不离十
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:24.07,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}闭上眼睛 不用太紧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.41,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fade(0,500)}别睁眼就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.66,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,120,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}外面没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:34.97,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}你什么声音都没听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.52,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:44.61,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}枪声
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.66,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,950,0,150,,{\fad(500,500)}究竟发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.99,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,650,190,,{\fad(500,0)}新计划
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:57.31,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,720,0,190,,{\fade(0,500)}噪音？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:57.31,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,420,170,,{\fade(0,500)}噪音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:03.15,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,200,,还记得怎么做吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:17.09,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,750,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}我觉得他们是可信的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.51,0:17:20.01,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.11,0:21:48.45,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,170,,{\fad(500,500)}我们该怎么穿过去？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:49.47,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,400,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他们在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.20,0:35:43.28,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,760,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我们为什么不能用手电筒？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.03,0:35:46.95,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,100,0,,他说这样才不会引起注意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.95,0:35:48.62,Subtitle-TLOU-手语右,,450,0,0,,但这里没有人呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.62,0:35:49.96,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,650,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.10,0:49:25.10,Subtitle-TLOU-手语左,,0,60,0,,{\fad(0,500)}你得睡了
